{
  "id": "cart-checkout",
  "title": "Cart checkout",
  "blurb": "A shopping cart is loaded by ID, its items are priced in a loop, and the total is charged to a card. Charge failures are caught and a notification is sent. Pricing runs at least twice through the loop.",
